I</a><a href="/symphony" class="ob-dd-link">Symphony</a><a href="/web-ui" class="ob-dd-link">Web UI</a><a href="/onboarding" class="ob-dd-link">Onboarding</a><a href="/partners" class="ob-dd-link">Partners and vendors</a><a href="/status" class="ob-dd-link">Service status</a></div></li><li class="ob-menu-item"><a href="/regulation" class="ob-menu-link">Regulation</a><div class="ob-dropdown"><a href="/regulation" class="ob-dd-link">Regulatory status</a><a href="/rulebook" class="ob-dd-link">MTF Rulebook</a><a href="/fees" class="ob-dd-link">Fees</a><a href="/regulatory-updates" class="ob-dd-link">Regulatory updates</a><a href="/disclosures" class="ob-dd-link">Disclosures</a></div></li><li class="ob-menu-item"><a href="/insights" class="ob-menu-link">Insights</a><div class="ob-dropdown"><a href="/insights" class="ob-dd-link">All insights</a><a href="/press" class="ob-dd-link">Press and media</a><a href="/events" class="ob-dd-link">Events and webinars</a><a href="/glossary" class="ob-dd-link">Glossary</a></div></li><li class="ob-menu-item"><a href="/about" class="ob-menu-link">About</a><div class="ob-dropdown"><a href="/about" class="ob-dd-link">Company and leadership</a><a href="/careers" class="ob-dd-link">Careers</a><a href="/contact" class="ob-dd-link">Contact</a><a href="/request-a-demo" class="ob-dd-link">Request a demo</a></div></li></ul><div class="ob-utils"><a href="https://app.optaxemtf.com/" class="ob-btn-line">MTF Login</a><a href="/client-area" class="ob-utils-link">Client Area</a><a href="/request-a-demo" class="ob-btn-primary ob-hide-mob">Request a demo</a><a id="ob-burger" aria-label="Open menu" type="button" href="#" class="ob-burger w-button">☰</a></div></div><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
/* Mobile menu: scrollable, and collapsed into an accordion so the whole menu
   fits a phone screen instead of running to about 1,400px. */
@media screen and (max-width: 991px){
  #ob-menu{
    max-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    max-height: calc(100dvh - 72px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    overscroll-behavior: contain;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }
  #ob-menu > .ob-menu-item + .ob-menu-item{
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
    margin-top: 4px;
    padding-top: 4px;
  }
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-link{
    padding-top: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
  }
  #ob-menu .ob-dropdown a{
    padding-top: 8px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* Groups start closed. The !important is deliberate: the site's nav script
     sets an inline display on these when hovering on desktop, and that inline
     style would otherwise win after a resize. */
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-dd] > .ob-dropdown{
    display: none !important;
  }
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-open="true"] > .ob-dropdown{
    display: block !important;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  /* Chevron, drawn with borders so it does not depend on a font or an icon. */
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-dd] > .ob-menu-link{
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-dd] > .ob-menu-link::after{
    content: "";
    flex: none;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    margin-right: 2px;
    border-right: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid currentColor;
    transform: rotate(45deg) translateY(-2px);
    transition: transform .18s ease;
    opacity: .7;
  }
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-open="true"] > .ob-menu-link::after{
    transform: rotate(-135deg) translateY(1px);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
  #ob-menu .ob-menu-item[data-ob-dd] > .ob-menu-link::after{ transition: none; }
}

/* Sitewide: give the pill room to breathe above the heading that follows it. */
.ob-badge{
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

/* Step rows did not collapse on phones, pushing the page sideways. */
@media screen and (max-width: 767px){
  .ob-steps,
  .ob-steps.ob-steps-3,
  .ob-steps.ob-steps-4{
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
<script>
/* Mobile navigation accordion.
   Below 992px, tapping a group heading opens that group and closes the others,
   rather than navigating. Nothing is lost by intercepting the tap: the first
   link inside every group is the group's own page. Desktop is untouched, where
   the site's existing nav script still handles hover and the heading still
   navigates. */
(function () {
  try {
    var menu = document.getElementById('ob-menu');
    if (!menu) return;

    var mq = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 991px)');
    var groups = [].slice.call(menu.querySelectorAll('.ob-menu-item')).filter(function (li) {
      return li.querySelector('.ob-dropdown') && li.querySelector('.ob-menu-link');
    });

    var setOpen = function (li, open) {
      li.setAttribute('data-ob-open', open ? 'true' : 'false');
      var link = li.querySelector('.ob-menu-link');
      if (link) link.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
    };

    groups.forEach(function (li) {
      li.setAttribute('data-ob-dd', '');
      setOpen(li, false);
      li.querySelector('.ob-menu-link').addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        if (!mq.matches) return;
        e.preventDefault();
        var wasOpen = li.getAttribute('data-ob-open') === 'true';
        groups.forEach(function (other) { if (other !== li) setOpen(other, false); });
        setOpen(li, !wasOpen);
      });
    });

    var reset = function () {
      if (!mq.matches) groups.forEach(function (li) { setOpen(li, false); });
    };
    if (mq.addEventListener) mq.addEventListener('change', reset);
    else if (mq.addListener) mq.addListener(reset);
  } catch (e) {}
})();
</script></div></nav><main id="ob-main" class="ob-page"><div><section class="ob-hero-paper"><div class="ob-container"><p class="ob-eyebrow-dark">For OMS, EMS and vendors</p><h1 class="ob-h1">Connect your clients and systems</h1><p class="ob-lead-dark">Intermediaries can integrate with OptAxe directly, providing authenticated access for clients to screen and trade axes. OMS, EMS, pricing and analytics suppliers can integrate across the venue&#x27;s APIs (FIX, REST/WS) to bring real-time market intelligence and liquidity to mutual clients.</p></div></section><section class="ob-section"><div class="ob-container"><div class="ob-compare"><div class="ob-compare-col"><span class="ob-badge">Brokers and intermediaries</span><h2 class="ob-h3">Work interest for clients on a regulated venue</h2><p class="ob-p">Brokers who already intermediate FX options business can become participants, onboard their own clients under the Rulebook, and post or screen interest on their behalf. Execute on venue directly.</p><ul role="list" class="ob-list"><li class="ob-list-item">Participant status.</li><li class="ob-list-item">Direct access to market makers.</li><li class="ob-list-item">Web UI and consolidated axes.</li></ul></div><div class="ob-compare-col"><span class="ob-badge">OMS and EMS platforms</span><h2 class="ob-h3">Integrate once, serve every mutual client</h2><p class="ob-p">Order management systems can take a direct feed from OptAxe&#x27;s API to allow screening and trading of axes. Execution Management Systems can also integrate via FIX API directly.</p><ul role="list" class="ob-list"><li class="ob-list-item">REST/WS for inventory, request state and trade reports.</li><li class="ob-list-item">FIX for pricing and execution on behalf of market-maker clients.</li><li class="ob-list-item">Symphony for notifications into existing chat workflows.</li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class="ob-section-paper"><div class="ob-container"><div class="ob-section-head"><p class="ob-kicker">Partner process</p><h2 class="ob-h2">How partnership works</h2></div><div class="ob-steps"><div class="ob-step"><div class="ob-step-num">1</div><h3 class="ob-step-title">Scope</h3><p class="ob-step-text">A short call to establish which clients or systems are involved and which access method fits.</p></div><div class="ob-step"><div class="ob-step-num">2</div><h3 class="ob-step-title">Documentation</h3><p class="ob-step-text">Review the Rulebook and sign the Participant agreement.</p></div><div class="ob-step"><div class="ob-step-num">3</div><h3 class="ob-step-title">Test and connect</h3><p class="ob-step-text">Connect to OptAxe UAT, connect your clients and counterparties. Resolve any mapping issues.</p></div><div class="ob-step"><div class="ob-step-num">4</div><h3 class="ob-step-title">Go live</h3><p class="ob-step-text">Production credentials and access to a single source of OTC FX and PMO option axes.</p></div></div><div class="ob-cta-row"><a href="/partners" class="ob-btn-dark">Current partners</a><a href="/contact" class="ob-btn-outline">Contact</a></div></div></section></div><div id="ob-placeholder" class="ob-container"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer ob-container w-container"><p class="ob-p">See also: guidance for the other participant types on the venue.</p><div class="ob-cta-row"><a href="/market-makers" class="ob-btn-outline">For market makers</a><a href="/buy-side" class="ob-btn-outline">For buy-side firms</a></div></div></div></main><footer class="ob-footer"><div class="ob-footer-inner"><div class="ob-footer-grid ob-footer-min"><div class="ob-footer-brand"><svg aria-label="OptAxe" role="img" viewBox="157.12 487.12 1359.02 211.15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="ob-footer-logo ob-footer-logo"><path d="m559.39,648.68c-32.13,0-59.11-25.8-59.11-58.4,0-11.28,3.21-21.7,8.74-30.49-6.59-6.59-13.18-13.19-19.78-19.78-10.79,13.76-17.1,31.06-17.1,50.27,0,46.91,37.99,83.26,87.01,83.26,18.54,0,35.49-5.2,49.42-14.2-6.34-6.34-12.67-12.67-19.01-19.01-8.8